<p><strong>L=C3=A0 m=E1=BB=99t (As a):</strong> Nh=C3=A2n vi=C3=AAn MC (Mat=
erial Control)</p>
<p><strong>T=C3=B4i mu=E1=BB=91n (I want):</strong> H=E1=BB=87 th=E1=BB=91n=
g t=E1=BB=B1 =C4=91=E1=BB=99ng ph=C3=A1t hi=E1=BB=87n, =C4=91=C6=B0a ra c=
